# What clasp may send to the Drive bridge Apps Script project. Paths are relative to rootDir
# (apps-script), and clasp replaces the whole project with whatever is left after these rules —
# so this is a deliberate allow-list, not a block-list.
#
# Code.gs must stay out of it: that is the old Google Sheet version of the system, a different
# Apps Script project (bound to the Sheet), kept only so its data can be brought across.
**/**
!appsscript.json
!DriveBridge.gs
